Subject: Connect mechanisms only after their owners are clear
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 08:40:00 +0000
Message-ID: <ownership-before-mechanism@inkcre.acceptance>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An integration becomes maintainable when each fact has one authority and each
effect has one owner.  Shared helpers can remove repetition, but they should not
quietly acquire the lifecycle of the domains that call them.
